  "caption_groups": [
    {
      "start": 0.852083,
      "end": 3.1177490000000003,
      "text": "Beavers live in freshwater ecosystems such"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.13075,
      "end": 5.5395829999999995,
      "text": "as rivers, streams, lakes and ponds."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.264083,
      "end": 9.139123999999999,
      "text": "In Europe, beavers were reduced to"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.165125,
      "end": 11.469833,
      "text": "fragmented populations, with combined"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.482833,
      "end": 13.618248999999999,
      "text": "population numbers being estimated at"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.644290999999999,
      "end": 14.868291,
      "text": "limited individuals."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.180083,
      "end": 18.614998999999997,
      "text": "The concept became popular in conservation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.914458,
      "end": 20.268666,
      "text": "and was deployed in a range of"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.294666,
      "end": 22.755624,
      "text": "contexts and mobilized to engender support."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.088083,
      "end": 26.496957000000002,
      "text": "In addition, wolves often kept animals from"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.523,
      "end": 28.059457000000002,
      "text": "grazing in riparian areas,"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.345916000000003,
      "end": 30.259999,
      "text": "which protected beavers from having food"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.273,
      "end": 31.653208,
      "text": "sources encroached upon."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.980083,
      "end": 34.737916,
      "text": "The connectivity of streams to their"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.763958,
      "end": 36.808248999999996,
      "text": "adjacent floodplain along their entire"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.83425,
      "end": 38.54,
      "text": "length plays an important role in the"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.553,
      "end": 39.373332999999995,
      "text": "equilibrium."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.720082999999995,
      "end": 43.02479099999999,
      "text": "Stream restoration or river restoration,"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.18104099999999,
      "end": 44.925833,
      "text": "sometimes called river reclamation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.13416599999999,
      "end": 46.683665999999995,
      "text": "is a set of activities that aim"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.709666,
      "end": 48.467499,
      "text": "to improve environmental health."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.80408299999999,
      "end": 52.23899899999999,
      "text": "Human activities had damaged ecosystems,"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.44733299999999,
      "end": 54.75204099999999,
      "text": "such as by removing keystone predators from"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.76504099999999,
      "end": 55.92387499999999,
      "text": "the natural landscape."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.25608299999999,
      "end": 59.15716599999999,
      "text": "Combined population numbers for these"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.183165999999986,
      "end": 61.35766599999999,
      "text": "animals remained restricted to specific"
    },
    {
      "start": 61.38370799999999,
      "end": 63.72745799999999,
      "text": "locations across the European continent."
    }
  ],
